  or science  where this pie sets but like  it's so much better than even just like  a cooled pie like the frozen aspect of  it it's like the perfect like silky  ice creamy yet not quite as dense  consistency and now all you have left to  do is top it so i just spanked myself  so i topped this with a little bit more  of those crushed cookie crumbs that we  used for the base but again if you were  using the graham cracker crust you could  do whatever you want you could even just  not top it with anything because it's  delicious as is but there you go  if you love me as much as i love this  pie  subscribe to my youtube channel  actually fun fact this is what the team  made for me my first birthday at tasty  because i knew how much i love this pie  [Music]  you
 

